00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:59.270
That is true that headaches,
fevers, muscle aches

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:01.010
are the most common symptoms.

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:04.360
Now the influenza virus
does affect both the upper

00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:05.910
and lower respiratory tract,

00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:07.950
so you can develop a very
serious cough as well

00:02:07.950 --> 00:02:10.580
as a sore throat,
serious nasal congestion.

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:12.740
The most common way my
patients describe it,

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:15.160
is usually like they've
been hit by a train.

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:17.410
Cause the fatigue and
body aches and fevers

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:18.630
are so uncomfortable.

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:20.070
That's really the hallmark symptom

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:20.920
that you get with a flu.

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:23.510
What happens when the virus
actually enters your body.

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:26.060
It enters through a
lock and key mechanism,

00:02:26.060 --> 00:02:27.700
enters the cell nucleus,

00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:29.830
which is sort of the brain of the cell,

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:32.550
and starts hijacking
the cell's own machinery

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:35.390
to copy itself and then
infect the rest of the body.

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:37.130
Now your body's defense system,

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:39.380
like this neutrophil and the T cell here,

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:41.830
as well as B cells and macrophages,

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:44.600
they all jump in, in defense of your body,

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:46.320
to try and eliminate this virus.

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:47.900
But here's where it gets tricky.

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:51.490
Your own cells are infected
with this flu virus,

00:02:51.490 --> 00:02:54.820
so these macrophages actually have to eat

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:57.580
your own body's cells in
order for you get better.

00:02:57.580 --> 00:02:59.940
And as you can already tell
where I'm going with this,

00:02:59.940 --> 00:03:01.680
if they have an overreaction,

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:03.690
especially in severe influenza cases,

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:05.240
that could be lethal on its own,

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:07.850
where your own body's inflammatory process

00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:10.800
that's meant to protect
you actually harms you.

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:11.650
Whoa.

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:14.400
