00:03:56.466 --> 00:03:57.299
(laughing)
(light happy music)

00:03:57.299 --> 00:03:58.132
Whoa.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:06.470
The macrophage itself,
when it consumes a part

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:09.970
of an infected cell, it's
able to tell the other parts

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:12.370
of the immune system like
the T cells and B cells

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:15.050
of what kind of virus
is infecting the body.

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:17.710
That's really important
in cell-mediated immunity,

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:19.980
where you body can
actually create a memory

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:22.030
so that if you're infected
with this virus again,

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.783
your body knows how to combat it.

00:04:25.642 --> 00:04:28.309
