00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:31.890
When we're talking about
the different types,

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:33.830
the influenza A, B, and C.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:36.220
A is really the most dangerous
cause it has the most

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:38.560
pandemic potential, meaning
that it could spread

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:40.010
and cause serious harm.

00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:42.980
In fact, the major outbreaks
like the Spanish flu of 1918,

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:48.350
swine flu, avian flu, those
were types of influenza A

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:50.780
that were devastating on populations.

