00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:28.770
This is really interesting.

00:05:28.770 --> 00:05:30.670
So the infected cells remember,

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:33.330
are actually hijacked
by the influenza virus,

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:35.760
therefore, producing more infected cells

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:38.980
or infected particles of the
virus that infect other cells.

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:41.010
What's really interesting
about the influenza virus

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:43.160
is that scientists have recently found out

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:46.910
that it's able to hide
itself from our immune system

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:49.080
and we're trying to make
strides in figuring out

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:52.540
how it does that, not only
for us to be able to counter

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:55.060
the influenza virus better, but also learn

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:57.380
about how it is we can protect ourselves

00:05:57.380 --> 00:06:00.880
from our own immune system
when it's over activated.

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:03.410
Think about those individuals
who suffer from autoimmune

00:06:03.410 --> 00:06:06.170
disorders, where their
own immune system affects

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:08.250
their intestines, their skin,

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:10.530
like Crohn's disease or psoriasis.

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:12.540
If we can figure out
how the influenza virus

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:14.120
hides from our immune system,

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:16.630
we can use that same
principle to shut down

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:18.919
the autoimmune issues that we can have.

