00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:45.993
So think about it.

00:06:45.993 --> 00:06:48.810
I could be totally fine, meaning
not showing any symptoms,

00:06:48.810 --> 00:06:51.810
sneeze and be passing the
influenza virus to someone

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:52.643
right next to me.

00:06:52.643 --> 00:06:54.218
Really problematic, right?

